  "note": "One fixed reward per fault. RESOURCE adds stock to the resolving sector's real tray; INTEGRITY restores health capped at the maximum; OPPORTUNITY stores one single-use token. Nothing is rolled and nothing is chosen. A scenario's fault_reward_overrides may replace an entry with the same shape. The F-5xx reference-chain faults (2026-10-04) pay from the same table as every other fault; nothing about a chain changes what finishing one is worth. BALANCE (2026-10-05): every sector's ten faults pay the same matrix on a different journey (see `balance`; docs/fault-reward-balance.md has the audit; test/reward-balance.test.js holds the matrix).",
